================================================================================
## Fix decision-table editor column removal
================================================================================

Context: In the Decision Table edit popup, after adding a second input column
there was no way to remove it. ``_dtRemoveColumn`` already existed and correctly
spliced columns/conditions, but the grid header never rendered a remove control
and the modal click handler only wired row removal.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-business-rules.js
   Render a remove-column control on each header when more than one column is
   present, and wire ``data-dt-remove-col`` clicks to ``_dtRemoveColumn``.
2. tests/units/front/test_decision_table_editor_help.py
   Assert the remove-column UI is present and that removing a column splices
   both headers and row conditions.

Modified files:
- src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-business-rules.js
- tests/units/front/test_decision_table_editor_help.py
- changelogs/v0.10.0/benoitcayladbx_2026-11-05.log

